```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Dashboard as DashboardComponent
    participant SignalR as MetricsHub
    participant JS as JSRuntime/ChartJS
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Swal as SweetAlert

    Note over Dashboard: Page load / initialization
    User->>Dashboard: Navigate to /Dashboard
    activate Dashboard
    Dashboard->>SignalR: Build HubConnection -> StartAsync()
    SignalR-->>Dashboard: Connected / Reconnected / Closed events

    Note over Dashboard: AfterRender -> chart init
    Dashboard->>JS: invoke "initializeMemoryChart" (dotNetRef)
    JS-->>Dashboard: callback -> Dashboard.UpdateChartAsync()

    Note over SignalR and Dashboard: real-time metrics
    SignalR-->>Dashboard: ReceiveHistory(List<PerformanceMetrics>)
    Dashboard->>JS: UpdateChartAsync (if chart initialized)
    JS-->>Dashboard: chart updated

    SignalR-->>Dashboard: ReceiveMetrics(PerformanceMetrics)
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: update _currentMetrics, append _history, StateHasChanged()
    Dashboard->>JS: UpdateChartAsync()
    JS-->>Dashboard: chart updated

    Note over User/API: Benchmarks flow
    User->>Dashboard: Click RunBenchmark
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/benchmark/run
    API-->>Dashboard: BenchmarkResponseDto (Status)
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: set _isBenchmarkRunning = true
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: start PollBenchmarkStatus()

    loop Polling while running
        Dashboard->>API: GET /api/benchmark/status
        API-->>Dashboard: BenchmarkResponseDto (IsRunning)
        alt finished (IsRunning == false)
            Dashboard->>API: GET /api/benchmark/results
            API-->>Dashboard: BenchmarkResultDto
            Dashboard->>Swal: show completion/cancel alert
            Dashboard-->>User: Render <BenchmarkResults> modal
        end
    end

    Note over User/API: Cancel benchmark
    User->>Dashboard: Click CancelBenchmark
    Dashboard->>JS: confirm(...) via JSRuntime
    alt confirmed
        Dashboard->>API: POST /api/benchmark/cancel
        API-->>Dashboard: cancel response
        Dashboard->>Swal: notify cancellation
    end

    Note over User/API: Memory leak simulation
    User->>Dashboard: Click SimulateMemoryLeak
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/memory-leak/simulate-leak?mb=5
    API-->>Dashboard: success/failure
    Dashboard->>Swal: show message
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: _isCleanButtonDisabled = false

    User->>Dashboard: Click CleanMemoryLeak
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/memory-leak/clear-leak
    API-->>Dashboard: ack
    Dashboard->>Swal: show "Memory Leak Stopped!"
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: _isCleanButtonDisabled = true
```
